{"name": "Ryn: And the thread of life", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The world is unraveling:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dark witch Stella has torn the sacred Thread of Life, and now magic bleeds in corrupt shreds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Ryn, a rag doll born from the last fragment of light, you journey through the dying heart of a withering realm. Each step reveals new horrors... and new powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The five wicked dolls guard the stolen fragments. Defeat their nightmares, master their abilities, and reweave fate with the edge of your magical scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/bb42fe8d6bb21f1d04c88ca0a9292a02.poster.avif?t=1778883207\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/bb42fe8d6bb21f1d04c88ca0a9292a02.webm?t=1778883207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/bb42fe8d6bb21f1d04c88ca0a9292a02.mp4?t=1778883207\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combat:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast, fluid, and visceral hack-and-slash combat in constant motion. Chain light and heavy attacks, dodge with precision, and unleash powerful abilities stolen from fallen enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick Time Events turn battles into cinematic showdowns that demand reflexes and reward skill. Every strike with Ryn\u2019s enchanted scissors doesn\u2019t just wound... it cuts through destiny itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/d7a79036d930757a7179b1b5ddc12fcb.poster.avif?t=1778883207\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/d7a79036d930757a7179b1b5ddc12fcb.webm?t=1778883207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/d7a79036d930757a7179b1b5ddc12fcb.mp4?t=1778883207\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Exploration:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a 3D metroidvania-style interconnected world, where every area is filled with secrets, shortcuts, and hidden paths. Progress is unlocked by gaining new abilities after intense boss battles, allowing you to revisit previous zones and uncover what was once unreachable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/8842ca7c319177f42d63817bb7e6e083.poster.avif?t=1778883207\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/8842ca7c319177f42d63817bb7e6e083.webm?t=1778883207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/8842ca7c319177f42d63817bb7e6e083.mp4?t=1778883207\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Progression:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To confront the evil Witch Stella, you must first vanquish the five corrupted dolls that guard her domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hard-fought victory bestows powerful new abilities, unlocking hidden paths and forgotten realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/91304bb37720f8942cec6030c4679949.poster.avif?t=1778883207\" width=\"500\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/91304bb37720f8942cec6030c4679949.webm?t=1778883207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/extras/91304bb37720f8942cec6030c4679949.mp4?t=1778883207\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Credits:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daniel Aponte:</strong> Art &amp; Animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ariel Aponte:</strong> Programming &amp; game design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Innombrable Games</strong> - Buenos Aires, Argentina</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A 3D metroidvania hack-and-slash with low-poly and pixel art aesthetics. As Ryn, a rag doll born from the last light, explore a fading realm torn by the dark witch Stella. Defeat the five wicked dolls, claim their powers, and restore the broken Thread of Life.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130370/a05390c26bcf82dbf91e861c7d594119f22a7030/header.jpg?t=1778883207", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Metroidvania", "Hack and Slash", "Anime", "Action", "Adventure", "3D"], "developers": "Innombrable", "publishers": "Innombrable", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming So